             <string>When an actor (the &quot;rider&quot;) attempts to climb onto and ride actors of this race (the &quot;mount&quot;), the rider will be snapped to this position relative to the mount, for their mounting animation. The coordinate system is the same as usual for actors: positive-X points to the right, positive-Y points forward, and positive-Z points up.</string>
