&lt;p&gt;In Skyrim, the baseline visuals for an actor's body are determined by an Armor form designed to be used as a &quot;skin.&quot; If you wish to modify a race's textures, you should edit the Armor and ArmorAddons that make up their skin. Note that it's common for multiple races to use the same ArmorAddons to provide their skins.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
